('117.114.b.1.B',4,'The size relationship between a hand and a face in a portrait is...','["mood", "proportion", "noise", "temperature"]'::jsonb,1,'Proportion compares sizes.','original'),
('117.114.b.1.C',3,'Color, line and shape are called the elements of art. They work like...','["rules", "prizes", "building blocks", "weather"]'::jsonb,2,'Elements are building blocks.','original'),
